{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2022-06-21 08:02:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK NAMED ONE OF THE TOP 75 COMPANIES FOR EXECUTIVE WOMEN BY SERAMOUNT FOR THE SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "DALLAS , JUNE 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 KIMBERLY-CLARK \xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WAS NAMED ONE OF THE TOP 75 COMPANIES FOR EXECUTIVE WOMEN BY SERAMOUNT FOR THE SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR. THE LIST RECOGNIZES U.S.-BASED CORPORATIONS THAT CHAMPION WOMEN'S ADVANCEMENT IN LEADERSHIP ROLES, WITH A FOCUS ON SUCCESSION PLANNING, GENDER PAY PARITY, BENEFITS PROGRAMS AND FLEXIBLE WORK POLICIES."}